This repository is a production-oriented continuation of the original private
"Clustering-with-LLM" project by MostafaK66. Its classical K-means,
K-Prototypes, ECOD, PCA, t-SNE, and SentenceTransformer workflows were used as
the behavioral baseline for this restructuring. ECOD remains available through an
optional PyOD adapter; Isolation Forest is the portable default because PyOD's
native Numba/LLVM dependency is not uniformly available on supported platforms.

